# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 15. Project submission reminders
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Files we WANT in GitHub:
# - README.md
# - requirements.txt
# - .gitignore
# - *.py source files
# - *.ipynb Colab notebooks
# - reports/*.pdf (preliminary report)
# - configuration and experiment documentation

# Files we DO NOT WANT in GitHub:
# - MRI datasets and patient records
# - Trained model weights
# - Model checkpoints
# - Downloaded archives
# - Credentials and API tokens

# IMPORTANT:
# .gitignore does not remove previously tracked files.
# Review repository contents before submission.
